{"doc": "Sums of the main diagonal and the anti-diagonal of a matrix (cells convertible with int), returned as [main, anti]; the centre cell shared by both diagonals is handled by center: both, main_only, anti_only or skip. Only the diagonal cells are read, O(n).", "complexity": "cells", "generator": [{"kind": "grid", "chars": "0123456789"}, {"kind": "value", "value": "main_only"}], "sizes": [100, 900], "tests": [{"args": [[[5]], "main_only"], "expected": [5, 0]}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [3, 4]], "main_only"], "expected": [5, 5]}, {"args": [[[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]], "main_only"], "expected": [15, 10]}, {"args": [[[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]], "both"], "expected": [15, 15]}, {"args": [[[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]], "skip"], "expected": [10, 10]}, {"args": [[[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]], "anti_only"], "expected": [10, 15]}, {"args": [[[2, 0], [0, 2]], "main_only"], "expected": [4, 0]}], "role": "diagonals", "drives": ["grid"], "requires": []}